<p>Board Game Planner stores only the information needed to run the app.</p>

<h2 class="h4">What we store</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Your account details: email address and a hashed password.</li>
    <li>The game nights and games you create.</li>
    <li>Which game nights you have joined.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h4">How it is used</h2>
<p>
    This information is used only to run the site: to log you in, show your game nights
    and keep track of who is coming. It is not shared with third parties.
</p>

<p>This is a student project, so please don't enter any information you wouldn't want stored.</p>